[engl]
{100}{}{Lars}
{200}{}{You see Lars, the sergeant of the Junktown guards.}
{210}{}{You see a heavily muscled, scarred man with a mustache.}
{220}{}{He has scars from knife and bullet injuries. His corded muscles show a man hardened by
adversity.}
{230}{}{He bears the scars of previous wounds, and looks like an old hand.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Lars00]}
{2000}{}{Hey! You! We know about you, you monster!}
{2010}{}{[Done.]}
{3000}{}{We don't like your kind here. You've got about fifteen seconds before I blow your head
off.}
{3010}{}{[Done.]}
{4000}{}{Wanderer, you just screwed up. We needed evidence so that we could take down Gizmo all
nice and legal-like. Look, off the record, I'm happy to have that fat fuck out of the
picture, but we can't condone murder. You better leave Junktown and never come back.}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{You ready to help take down Gizmo?}
{5010}{}{You bet. Let's nail that tub.}
{5020}{}{Uh-huh.}
{5030}{}{No, I changed my mind.}
{5040}{}{Nuh-uh.}
{6000}{}{All right, let's do it.}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Well, you'd best wait here so you don't get caught in the crossfire.}
{7010}{}{[Done.]}
{8000}{}{Can I help you, stranger?}
{8010}{}{So, what's there to do around here?}
{8020}{}{Can you give me the big picture on Junktown?}
{8030}{}{Who're you?}
{8040}{}{Eergh.}
{8050}{}{If you're in charge of the guards here, I think I have some information for you.}
{8060}{}{Killian sent me. We're going to take Gizmo down.}
{8070}{}{The Skulz are planning on killing Neal!}
{9000}{}{Plenty, so long as you stay on our good side. We got Killian Darkwaters' store, where
you can do some trading. And there's Gizmo's Casino, if you're a gambler. Or if you just
want a drink, you can head on over to the Skum Pitt. Just don't get too rowdy.}
{9010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Goodbyes]}
{9020}{}{Hey, I like a rowdy time!}
{10000}{}{Well, you'd best keep yourself under control. We're a free town but we don't tolerate
stepping on other people's toes. Don't cause any problems and you won't give cause for
me and my men to come down on you.}
{10010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Goodbyes]}
{10020}{}{What a stick in the mud!}
{11000}{}{Look, buddy, my job here is to keep the peace, and if I have to break a few heads to do
it, then a few people are going to be hurting. So just watch it.}
{11010}{}{[Done.]}
{12000}{}{Me and my men here work for Killian Darkwater. We keep some order in this town, dealing
with all of the murderers, thieves, and other scumbags who come in from the desert. If
you want my advice, you'll also stay away from Gizmo. That fathead runs a crooked
operation, but we just haven't been able to prove anything. He and his lackeys, the
Skulz, are going to take the fall sometime soon, if Killian has anything to say about
it.}
{12010}{}{What a bummer. No fun here at all.}
{12020}{}{Good to know that someone's keeping the peace around here. Thanks.}
{12030}{}{So, what keeps you lawboys from just busting Gizmo and the Skulz?}
{13000}{}{Hey, it's our job. But it's good to know that someone appreciates it. Thanks.}
{13010}{}{[Done.]}
{14000}{}{Got to do it all proper like. We know that Gizmo runs a rigged operation and all, but we
need hard evidence to bring him down. Same with the Skulz; they rough someone up, we
bring one or two of 'em in, but nothing changes. We just don't have any direct evidence
tying them to any of the killings or muggings.}
{14010}{}{Maybe I can help you with that.}
{14020}{}{Well, good luck.}
{15000}{}{Hell, if you think you can get some dirt on either of them, we'd appreciate the help.
Killian's the one to talk to if you want to talk about Gizmo. But if you can get some
info on the Skulz, just come back to me and me and the boys will take care of them.}
{15010}{}{[Done.]}
{16000}{}{Thanks. Watch your back.}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{I'm the head of the guards here in Junktown. Name's Lars. For that matter, who are you,
stranger?
---
I'm
---
.}
{17010}{}{Killian sent me to help run Gizmo out of town.}
{17020}{}{Buzz off, I don't have to tell you anything.}
{18000}{}{Move along there, fella.}
{18010}{}{[Done.]}
{19000}{}{Yes, I'm in charge of the guards here. What do you have for me?}
{19010}{}{Nothing, just checking.}
{19020}{}{I have some testimony from Sherry that the Skulz are involved in some illegal
activities.}
{20000}{}{Look, this isn't a game. People are getting hurt here. If you find some real evidence,
come back, but otherwise, don't waste my time!}
{20010}{}{[Done.]}
{21000}{}{Excellent. I'll pick her up for a few questions, and I'm sure that I'll get all the
information that I need to put them away.}
{21010}{}{[Done.]}
{22000}{}{What? Hmm. We'll see about that. I'll send some men over to ambush them when they try
it. You gonna be there?}
{22010}{}{No thanks, I've done my good deed for the day.}
{22020}{}{Yes.}
{23000}{}{Thanks for your assistance. Junktown's a little safer now, because of your help.}
{23010}{}{[Done.]}
{24000}{}{Good day, traveler. Do you need something?
---
Hello again! What can I do for you?
---
What?}
{24010}{}{The Skulz are planning on killing Neal!}
{24020}{}{I'm looking for a little work.}
{24030}{}{Just stopping by to say hello.}
{24040}{}{I have testimony about the illegal activities that the Skulz were involved in.}
{25000}{}{If you're not averse to a little skullduggery, I need someone to get some hard evidence
on the Skulz, proving that they're involved in illegal activities here. Or you can talk
to Killian; he might have some work for you.}
{25010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Goodbyes]}
{26000}{}{So, you have some info on the Skulz, eh? What can you tell me?}
{26010}{}{I've convinced one of them, Sherry, to testify that they were involved in criminal
activity.}
{26020}{}{They're involved in some muggings and killings here.}
{27000}{}{That's great and all, but I can't just jail them all on one person's say-so. I need hard
evidence or inside testimony.}
{27010}{}{I'll see what I can do.}
{27020}{}{I've got testimony from Sherry, a former gang member.}

